You summon a Rime Wraith inside of you, an intangible creature, that haunts both foes and allies for [10, 13, 15, 18, 20 (TL1-5)] turns.

Every turn the wraith will select a new target and jump to it.

When the wraith enters a creature they are covered in hoarfrost for 3 turns:

*  if friendly: increases cold resistance by [10%, 16%, 20%, 26%, 30% (TL1-5)], converts all damage done to cold and increases cold damage by [12%, 18%, 22%, 26%, 30% (TL1-5)].
*  if hostile: reduces cold resistance by [5%, 8%, 10%, 13%, 15% (TL1-5)] and move [20%, 26%, 31%, 36%, 40% (TL1-5)] slower

When selecting a target the wraith prefers one that is not affected by hoarfrost if possible.
